=== $sscanf Test ===
Test 1: Parse integer
  $sscanf("42", "%d") -> int_val = 42, returned 1
  PASS: Integer parsed correctly
  $sscanf("-123", "%d") -> int_val = -123
  PASS: Negative integer parsed
Test 2: Parse multiple integers
  $sscanf("10 20", "%d %d") -> 10, 20 (returned 2)
  PASS: Two integers parsed
Test 3: Parse hexadecimal
  $sscanf("ff", "%x") -> hex_val = 0xff
  PASS: Hex value parsed
  $sscanf("DEADBEEF", "%x") -> hex_val = 0xdeadbeef
